set security policies from-zone vpn to-zone trust policy permit-lab match destination-address lab-hosts
set security policies from-zone vpn to-zone trust policy permit-lab match application lab-apps
set security policies from-zone vpn to-zone trust policy permit-lab then permit
set security policies from-zone vpn to-zone trust policy permit-lab then log session-close
