set security policies from-zone vpn to-zone trust policy deny-all match destination-address any
set security policies from-zone vpn to-zone trust policy deny-all match application any
set security policies from-zone vpn to-zone trust policy deny-all then deny
set security policies from-zone vpn to-zone trust policy deny-all then log session-init
set security policies from-zone trust to-zone untrust policy permit-inet match source-address any
set security policies from-zone trust to-zone untrust policy permit-inet match destination-address any
set security policies from-zone trust to-zone untrust policy permit-inet match application junos-https
set security policies from-zone trust to-zone untrust policy permit-inet match application junos-icmp-all
set security policies from-zone trust to-zone untrust policy permit-inet then permit
set security policies from-zone trust to-zone untrust policy permit-inet then log session-close
set security policies from-zone trust to-zone untrust policy deny-all match source-address any
set security policies from-zone trust to-zone untrust policy deny-all match destination-address any
set security policies from-zone trust to-zone untrust policy deny-all match application any
set security policies from-zone trust to-zone untrust policy deny-all then deny
set security policies from-zone trust to-zone untrust policy deny-all then log session-init
set security policies from-zone trust to-zone trust policy deny-all match source-address any
set security policies from-zone trust to-zone trust policy deny-all match destination-address any
set security policies from-zone trust to-zone trust policy deny-all match application any
set security policies from-zone trust to-zone trust policy deny-all then deny
set security policies from-zone trust to-zone trust policy deny-all then log session-init
set security policies from-zone untrust to-zone trust policy deny-all match source-address any
set security policies from-zone untrust to-zone trust policy deny-all match destination-address any
set security policies from-zone untrust to-zone trust policy deny-all match application any
set security policies from-zone untrust to-zone trust policy deny-all then deny
set security policies from-zone untrust to-zone trust policy deny-all then log session-init
set security policies from-zone untrust to-zone untrust policy deny-all match source-address any
set security policies from-zone untrust to-zone untrust policy deny-all match destination-address any
set security policies from-zone untrust to-zone untrust policy deny-all match application any
set security policies from-zone untrust to-zone untrust policy deny-all then deny
set security policies from-zone untrust to-zone untrust policy deny-all then log session-init
set security policies from-zone untrust to-zone vpn policy deny-all match source-address any
set security policies from-zone untrust to-zone vpn policy deny-all match destination-address any
set security policies from-zone untrust to-zone vpn policy deny-all match application any
set security policies from-zone untrust to-zone vpn policy deny-all then deny
set security policies from-zone untrust to-zone vpn policy deny-all then log session-init
set security policies from-zone vpn to-zone untrust policy deny-all match source-address any
set security policies from-zone vpn to-zone untrust policy deny-all match destination-address any
set security policies from-zone vpn to-zone untrust policy deny-all match application any
set security policies from-zone vpn to-zone untrust policy deny-all then deny
set security policies from-zone vpn to-zone untrust policy deny-all then log session-init
set security policies from-zone vpn to-zone vpn policy deny-all match source-address any
set security policies from-zone vpn to-zone vpn policy deny-all match destination-address any
set security policies from-zone vpn to-zone vpn policy deny-all match application any
set security policies from-zone vpn to-zone vpn policy deny-all then deny
set security policies from-zone vpn to-zone vpn policy deny-all then log session-init
set security policies default-policy deny-all
set security policies pre-id-default-policy then log session-close
set security address-book global address hq-servers 10.66.161.0/24
set security address-book global address hq-dmz 10.66.162.0/24
set security address-book global address br1-users 10.66.151.0/24
set security address-book global address br1-iot 10.66.152.0/24
set security address-book global address br2-users 10.66.171.0/24
set security address-book global address-set lab-hosts address hq-servers
set security address-book global address-set lab-hosts address hq-dmz
set security address-book global address-set lab-hosts address br1-users
set security address-book global address-set lab-hosts address br2-users
set security flow tcp-mss ipsec-vpn mss 1350
set interfaces ge-0/0/0 unit 0 family inet address 10.66.183.2/24
set interfaces ge-0/0/1 unit 0 family inet address 10.66.171.1/24
set interfaces fxp0 unit 0 family inet address 192.168.1.210/24
set interfaces st0 unit 1 family inet address 10.66.250.6/30
set applications application-set lab-apps application junos-icmp-all
set applications application-set lab-apps application junos-ssh
set applications application-set lab-apps application junos-https
